{"words": [{"text": "وَأَتِمُّوا۟", "translation": "And complete"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَجَّ", "translation": "the Hajj"}, {"text": "وَٱلْعُمْرَةَ", "translation": "and the Umrah"}, {"text": "لِلَّهِ ۚ", "translation": "for Allah"}, {"text": "فَإِنْ", "translation": "And if"}, {"text": "أُحْصِرْتُمْ", "translation": "you are held back"}, {"text": "فَمَا", "translation": "then (offer) whatever"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَيْسَرَ", "translation": "(can be) obtained with ease"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْهَدْىِ ۖ", "translation": "the sacrificial animal"}, {"text": "وَلَا", "translation": "And (do) not"}, {"text": "تَحْلِقُوا۟", "translation": "shave"}, {"text": "رُءُوسَكُمْ", "translation": "your heads"}, {"text": "حَتَّىٰ", "translation": "until"}, {"text": "يَبْلُغَ", "translation": "reaches"}, {"text": "ٱلْهَدْىُ", "translation": "the sacrificial animal"}, {"text": "مَحِلَّهُۥ ۚ", "translation": "(to) its destination"}, {"text": "فَمَن", "translation": "Then whoever"}, {"text": "كَانَ", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "مِنكُم", "translation": "among you"}, {"text": "مَّرِيضًا", "translation": "ill"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "بِهِۦٓ", "translation": "he (has)"}, {"text": "أَذًۭى", "translation": "an ailment"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "رَّأْسِهِۦ", "translation": "his head"}, {"text": "فَفِدْيَةٌۭ", "translation": "then a ransom"}, {"text": "مِّن", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "صِيَامٍ", "translation": "fasting"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "صَدَقَةٍ", "translation": "charity"}, {"text": "أَوْ", "translation": "or"}, {"text": "نُسُكٍۢ ۚ", "translation": "sacrifice"}, {"text": "فَإِذَآ", "translation": "Then when"}, {"text": "أَمِنتُمْ", "translation": "you are secure"}, {"text": "فَمَن", "translation": "then whoever"}, {"text": "تَمَتَّعَ", "translation": "took advantage"}, {"text": "بِٱلْعُمْرَةِ", "translation": "of the Umrah"}, {"text": "إِلَى", "translation": "followed"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَجِّ", "translation": "(by) the Hajj"}, {"text": "فَمَا", "translation": "then (offer) whatever"}, {"text": "ٱسْتَيْسَرَ", "translation": "(can be) obtained with ease"}, {"text": "مِنَ", "translation": "of"}, {"text": "ٱلْهَدْىِ ۚ", "translation": "the sacrificial animal"}, {"text": "فَمَن", "translation": "But whoever"}, {"text": "لَّمْ", "translation": "(can) not"}, {"text": "يَجِدْ", "translation": "find "}, {"text": "فَصِيَامُ", "translation": "then a fast"}, {"text": "ثَلَـٰثَةِ", "translation": "(of) three"}, {"text": "أَيَّامٍۢ", "translation": "days"}, {"text": "فِى", "translation": "during"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَجِّ", "translation": "the Hajj"}, {"text": "وَسَبْعَةٍ", "translation": "and seven (days)"}, {"text": "إِذَا", "translation": "when"}, {"text": "رَجَعْتُمْ ۗ", "translation": "you return"}, {"text": "تِلْكَ", "translation": "This"}, {"text": "عَشَرَةٌۭ", "translation": "(is) ten (days)"}, {"text": "كَامِلَةٌۭ ۗ", "translation": "in all"}, {"text": "ذَٰلِكَ", "translation": "That"}, {"text": "لِمَن", "translation": "(is) for (the one) whose"}, {"text": "لَّمْ", "translation": "not"}, {"text": "يَكُنْ", "translation": "is"}, {"text": "أَهْلُهُۥ", "translation": "his family"}, {"text": "حَاضِرِى", "translation": "present"}, {"text": "ٱلْمَسْجِدِ", "translation": "(near) Al-Masjid"}, {"text": "ٱلْحَرَامِ ۚ", "translation": "Al-Haraam"}, {"text": "وَٱتَّقُوا۟", "translation": "And fear"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "وَٱعْلَمُوٓا۟", "translation": "and know"}, {"text": "أَنَّ", "translation": "that"}, {"text": "ٱللَّهَ", "translation": "Allah"}, {"text": "شَدِيدُ", "translation": "(is) severe"}, {"text": "ٱلْعِقَابِ", "translation": "(in) retribution"}], "sahih": "And complete the ḥajj and ʿumrah for Allāh. But if you are prevented, then [offer] what can be obtained with ease of sacrificial animals. And do not shave your heads until the sacrificial animal has reached its place of slaughter. And whoever among you is ill or has an ailment of the head [making shaving necessary must offer] a ransom of fasting [three days] or charity1 or sacrifice.2 And when you are secure,3 then whoever performs ʿumrah [during the ḥajj months]4 followed by ḥajj [offers] what can be obtained with ease of sacrificial animals. And whoever cannot find [or afford such an animal] - then a fast of three days during ḥajj and of seven when you have returned [home]. Those are ten complete [days]. This is for those whose family is not in the area of al-Masjid al-Ḥarām. And fear Allāh and know that Allāh is severe in penalty."}